<title>HONG KONG: ING Baring sets warrants on China Travel.</title>
<headline>ING Baring sets warrants on China Travel.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Baring Financial Products Hong Kong Branch said on Friday it intended to issue 695 million American style call warrants on shares of China Travel International Investment Hong Kong Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$3.9875	PREMIUM	   22.05 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$0.08792     GEARING	   4.54x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  16.JAN.98	EXER LOT	  20,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$3.9875</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
